# Charles Gumera Portfolio

Source code for my personal portfolio website.

## Overview

A personal portfolio showcasing my work in video editing, Pinterest operations,
short-form publishing systems, and graphic design.

## Structure

- `index.html` — Homepage
- `short-form-and-long-form-video-editing.html` — Video editing
- `pinterest-content-operations-system.html` — Pinterest operations
- `short-form-publishing-workflow-system.html` — Short-form publishing system
- `graphic-design.html` — Graphic design
- `css/` — Stylesheets
- `js/` — JavaScript
- `assets/` — Website images and other assets

## Local development

Run the website using a local development server.

## Media

Some portfolio videos are embedded from Vimeo.

## Status

Active portfolio website.
